        <mxCell id="FS-BcXCiowx4MnNQ4kOs-58" parent="bVKxj864shOD7K9TONzq-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;[F8]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;You see a camp full of goblins. They are gathered around a big fire eating. At the edge of the camp you see an orc woman in a cage. What do you do?&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="107.5" width="280" x="2010" y="681.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FS-BcXCiowx4MnNQ4kOs-70" parent="bVKxj864shOD7K9TONzq-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;[END3]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;With a loud crack the lock falls to the ground in pieces. You look back to the camp and see every single goblin staring at you. You try to fight them off but there are to many. You have died...&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="116.25" width="280" x="3500" y="676.88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9tBxEngt5iG6m06beJ8u-11" parent="bVKxj864shOD7K9TONzq-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;[R8]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The dwarf jumps out from the barrel with surprising dexterity. He draws an axe and takes a battle stance.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="77.5" width="280" x="2340" y="1023.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9tBxEngt5iG6m06beJ8u-21" parent="bVKxj864shOD7K9TONzq-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;[R11]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;On the other side of the river, you spot a treasure chest hidden among the trees. You see stones in the water. You might be able to skip across, but the stones are wet and covered with seaweed. What do you do?&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="280" x="3780" y="1127.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9tBxEngt5iG6m06beJ8u-27" parent="bVKxj864shOD7K9TONzq-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;[END4]&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;You start skipping across the rocks. About halfway across the river you slip and bang your head on one of the other rocks. You loose consciousness as you fall into the river. You drown...&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
